        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_d",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Meanwhile, on the other side of the slums..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down! Say it again slowly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "B- but... all of them... they're all dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's happening? What happened? I can't see! I can't see anything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Report!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...phew."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...that smell. Don't panic! Everyone's still here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaah! It's red! I saw it! I saw the red!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm him down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "... (Inhuman laughing)."
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I want to go home... I want to go back to Ursus...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's ghosts here! And monsters! I saw the shadows... of two women!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaaaagh! I want to go home!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We shouldn't have come, Crownslayer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you copy? Answer me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The layout of these slums is confusing, but don't let the enemy confuse you. We are perfectly safe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "(How is our position still exposed with all the fog?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "There remains the traitor's position. I am aware.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "She is in Lungmen. Kill her. Make a name for yourself that your enemies should fear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns"
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "After you've killed your rival, then what? Don't forget your true enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_144_red_7#8",
        "fadetime": 0.4,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Who?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
